<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EST" style="id">- Selee Old Testament</book>
  <para style="h">ESTER</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ester Kukũ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ester</para>
  <para style="toc3">Est</para>
  <para style="mt1">ESTER</para>
  <para style="mt2">KUKŨ</para>
  <para style="imt">ODIKIOTUO</para>
  <para style="im">Sɛsaabla di<char style="bk">Ester Kukũ </char>, nle nse niawa ni di Persia ɔka-nɔɔfo lɛkayo le baatofo baata ni lɛwɔɔfɔ obe, dile ni Yuda ɔsanko onwii wɔ niawɛ ni sɛkambi baatɔɔlɛɛ ni Ester. Nnwɔ di sɛkambi nɔɔ osie ku ole ɔyɔ ɔta batii nɔɔ, aafũ ma ni nkpa di balo lɛma nnɛɛ alɛ batawɔɔsa ma nii. Kukũ nwu lɛkpasa kamɛ di Yuda batii suoto ɔlaa ku Purim dii ole lɛsɔdiki kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="iot">Kukũ Nwu Kamɛ Sɛlaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Ester labale ɔkasanko <char style="ior">1.1-2.23</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Haman kawumbe okũ <char style="ior">3.1-5.14</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Baalo Haman <char style="ior">6.1-7.10</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yuda batii lalenkee balo lɛma <char style="ior">8.1-10.3</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EST 1" />
  <para style="s1">Baatakatɛ Ɔkasanko Wasti Di Lɛkakpomii Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 1:1" />Nnya nle niawa ni di Akasweros obe kamɛ. Akasweros nwu lale sɛka di nsɔ kɔlafa afosi-anyɔ-nkuɛnsĩ suoto, diayɔ ni di India dialaadu ni Kus:<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kasɔ ka di Nil okle katoo kasɔ </char></note> <verse eid="EST 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 1:2" />Di obe nwu kamɛ Ɔka Akasweros latoole sɛka di lɛkakpomii nɔɔ suoto di Susa katanikokɔ kamɛ, <verse eid="EST 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 1:3" />ni di lɛlɛɛ tiɛfa di sɛka nɔɔ ole kamɛ, aatũ opunu aata batii finle nɔɔ bamuu ku banɔɔfotii nɛ. Persia Bakpɛtɛ batunletɛ ku Media, ɔka babi ku batii finle di nsɔ nwu suoto lawɛ ninfa.<verse eid="EST 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 1:4" />Di ayi kɔlafa afosi-anɛ amu kamɛ aadiki sɛka kalekɔ nɔɔ lɛsaawɛ kplɛ kayi ku sɛlɛ ninya ku sɛka ole nɔɔ lɛkpa aatuo. <verse eid="EST 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 1:5" />Obe wɔ di ayi ya mmle laloo nii, ɔka latũ opunu ayi akuɛnsĩ di lɛkayo nwu kɔba kamɛ aata batii bamuu, diayɔ ni di obisɔ dialaadu ni ɔnɔɔfo, mba niawɛ ni di Susa katanikokɔ nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="EST 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 1:6" />Di kɔba nwu kamɛ baasaka abula fɛnɛnɛɛ fututu ku bluu ale, baaninii ku sikũ fututu ku nse niabla ni fɛ ɔsɛɛ baakakaasa di koto fututu nkɔnii di afuɔwɛkyɛ akpaka suoto. Baase koto sɛɛle ku koto fututu akpomii yɔɔle di kaflɔnkɔ ka baabla ni ku lɛsaa le bɔɔlɛɛ ni porfri, afuɔwɛkyɛ, alɔdi apoo ku afuɔ bamba ya niefũ ni kɔya. <verse eid="EST 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 1:7" />Baatɔɔsɛ nta di koto sɛɛle sipũ kamɛ, obiala lakyi lete di owo ninwu, sɛka nwu nta kafɔɔ lapɔ, di mmle kanya di ɔka kadiki dibu antuo nii. <verse eid="EST 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 1:8" />Di ɔka kanya didiki kanya yi, baata otii biala osuku alɛ anyi di mmle kanya oomiɛ nii. Diekye ɔka latɔkɔ nta basɛtɛ alɛ bata otii biala mbe oomiɛ nii.<verse eid="EST 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 1:9" />Ɔkasanko Wasti kafɔɔ latũ opunu aata basanko ba niawɛ ni di Ɔka Akasweros lɛkayo kamɛ.<verse eid="EST 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 1:10" />Di dii kuɛsinle suoto, di obe wɔ di Ɔka Akasweros nfɛ kosiɛ ni nta osie kanya yi, ni aadiki basuɔtɔ ba ataa baadiki ni bakuɛnsĩ ba nikonyu nwɔ nii- Mehuman, Bista, Harbona, Bigta, Abagta, Setar ku Karkas- <verse eid="EST 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 1:11" />alɛ balaakpaa Ɔkasanko Wasti bawako nwɔ, di ɔsanko nwu atũkũ lɛkakoto nɔɔ, di mmle kanya aadiki ni sɛlɛ nɔɔ antuo ni batii nwu ku banɔɔfotii nwu, diekye aalɛ sekpeele baanyu nwɔ nii. <verse eid="EST 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 1:12" />Kafɔɔ obe wɔ di bakpɛmblatɛ nwu lalaabuɛ ni ɔka kanya yi, Ɔkasanko Wasti lasĩ ɔkyɛ. Ninfɛ di ɔblɔ lafiɛ ɔka, aanya ɔblɔ osie kanya nɛ.<verse eid="EST 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 1:13" />Di ɔsaabla kuale kuata ni ɔka alɛ aawolaa ni kamɛ di mba nin-ye ni kufiofa ku aka sɛlaa kamɛ nwaa oso yi, ni aakakatɛko banumbentɛ ba nianu ni obe nwu kamɛ ɔsaabla kasɔ nɛ, <verse eid="EST 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 1:14" />mma kafɔɔ niakaako ɔka kpinkpĩ nɛ- Karsena, Setar, Admata, Tarsis, Meres, Marsena ku Memukan, Persia ku Media batii finle bakuɛnsĩ nwu niawɛ osuku nwaa di ɔka suoto, baale ni kafɔɔ banɔɔfo bamu di sɛka kalekɔ nwu nɛ.<verse eid="EST 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 1:15" />Ni di Ɔka lakaalɛ alɛ, “Di kufiofa kanya, be dikaatɛ mambla Ɔkasanko Wasti? Ɔsanko nwu dienu Ɔka Akasweros kanya ka di mba ataa beediki ni lalaatɔkɔ nwɔ nii.”<verse eid="EST 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 1:16" />Ninfɛ di Memukan ladiki kanya di ɔka ku batii finle nwu anu alɛ, “Ɔkasanko Wasti lɛbla okpile, diele di ɔka lete suoto, kafɔɔ ku banɔɔfotii ku batii nwu bamuu di Ɔka Akasweros kasɔ kamuu suoto. <verse eid="EST 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 1:17" />Diekye ɔkasanko nwu kɔkpaa didiki kamabla ɔlaa kunte di basanko bamuu kamɛ, nioso babatoonyu basa lɛma nyakatãa mambuɛ alɛ, ‘Ɔka Akasweros ladiki kanya alɛ bakpaa Ɔkasanko Wasti bawako di anu nɔɔ, kafɔɔ atakyɛ.’  <verse eid="EST 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 1:18" />Miɛ dii le mmle Persia batii ku Media batii basanko banɔɔfotii ba nienu ni ɔkasanko kɔkpaa didikibi le mmle kamabla nkpo manta ɔka banɔɔfo bamuu. Ni lɛsaatambu ku nlɔ dilɔbaloo diidii.<verse eid="EST 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 1:19" />“Nioso, nse dilɛ diɛta ɔka, ni akpee ɔka kufiofa, aata bakpana kukũ di Persia ku Media afiofa kamɛ, mmle manamafuo kũ ni ɔkyɛlɛnsa, alɛ Wasti dilɔbasinkple awa ni Ɔka Akasweros anu diidii. Ɔka kafɔɔ ayɔ sɛka nɔɔ kayilakɔ ata otii bamba wɔ ninlɛ aalenke nwɔ ni. <verse eid="EST 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 1:20" />Ni nse beeyie ɔka kufiofa nwu lɛkya beefenko di kasɔ kplɛ nɔɔ kamuu suoto yi, ni basanko nwu bamuu, obisɔ ee ɔnɔɔfo kamabu basa lɛma.”<verse eid="EST 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 1:21" />Suoto layɔɔ ɔka ku banɔɔfotii ku ɔlaa wɔ mmle, nioso ɔka labla fɛ mmle di Memukan labuɛ nii. <verse eid="EST 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 1:22" />Ni di ɔka lakyesee akũ di sɛka kalekɔ aba amuu di kasɔ biala suoto di kɔkpana lɛma kumu ku batii biala di sele nɔɔ simu, aabuɛ di otii biala ɔkplalomii omu kamɛ alɛ osuɔtɔ biala ale kanyayilatɛ di leyo nɔɔ nimu batii suoto nɛ.<verse eid="EST 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EST 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ester Labale Ɔkasanko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 2:1" />Sɛmaa, obe wɔ di ɔblɔ layɔɔ ni Ɔka Akasweros, ni aanyuma Wasti ku lɛsaa le aabla ni ku kufiofa ko di nnwɔɔ ɔka aakpee ni di ɔsanko nwu suoto nɛ. <verse eid="EST 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 2:2" />Ninfɛ di ɔka omu bakpɛmblatɛ layɔ baatɛ alɛ, “Bita bakpekpee anu baamiɛ kakpeelebitɛ ka ninlɛ ni sekpeele bata ɔka. <verse eid="EST 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 2:3" />Biɛta ɔka adiki kanyabayilatɛ di kasɔ biala suoto di sɛka kalekɔ nɔɔ kamɛ, baakpaa basankobi ba mmle ninlɛ ni sekpeele bamuu bawako baka basɔfɔ dikudi nwu kamɛ di Susa katanikokɔ. Biɛta ma basiɛ di Hegai kalɔ, ɔka osuɔtɔ wɔ ataa baadiki ni, ayɛ ni di basanko dikudi nwu kanya; biɛta babla sekpeele sɛlɛ sɛsaabla bata ma. <verse eid="EST 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 2:4" />Ni biɛta ɔsankobi wɔ niebuo ni ɔka anu ale ɔkasanko di Wasti kanya.” Ɔlaa wɔ mmle labuo di ɔka kotoko, ni aafũ nwu aakpee nɛ.<verse eid="EST 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 2:5" />Obe nwu kamɛ Yuda otii onwii niakye ni Benyamin kɔna kamɛ lawɛ di Susa katanikokɔ nwu, leyooto nɔɔ niale Mordekai, Yair obisuɔtɔbi aale, ɔwa nɔɔ suɔtɔ niale Simei, ɔwatɛtɛ nɔɔ suɔtɔ kafɔɔ niale Kis nɛ, <verse eid="EST 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 2:6" />nnwɔ di Babel ɔka Nebukadnesa lakpaa ni di Yerusalem aasifiko ni sɛlanle kamɛ, manko mba baamufũ baasifiko ni ku Yuda ɔka Yehoiakin. <verse eid="EST 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 2:7" />Mordekai lawɛ ote bisɔnle obisankobi onwii baatɔɔlɛɛ ni Hadasa, nnwɔ aanyu ni disi aamuɔ nii, diekye ɔsankobi nwu ditasinwɛ kote ee kɔya. Ɔsankobi nwu, baakple baatɔɔlɛɛ ni Ester lalɛ sekpeele, aawɛ suoto kafɔɔ. Ni di Mordekai layɔ nwɔ fɛ obisankobi nɔɔ omu, di obe wɔ di ote ku ɔya lakpi ni nɛ.<verse eid="EST 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 2:8" />Obe wɔ baayie ni ɔka kanya ku kukũ lɛkya yi, baakpaa basankobi kpinwu baawako Susa katanikokɔ, baabayɔ ma baakpee di Hegai kalɔ. Baakpaa Ester kafɔɔ baakyɛnko lɛkayo, ni baayɔ nwɔ baakpee di Hegai nnɛɛ nɛ, nnwɔ niayila ni di baka basɔfɔ dikudi nwu kanya. <verse eid="EST 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 2:9" />Ɔsankobi nwu labuo Hegai anu, ni aale nwɔ sibualɛ nɛ. Nfanwu ni aata ɔsankobi nwu sɛlɛ nɔɔ sɛsaabla ku alesaa finle nɛ. Ninfɛ di Hegai lata Ester basanko bakɔkɔɔtɛ bakuɛnsĩ aadiki aakyeko ni lɛkayo, ni aadiki Ester ku bakɔkɔɔtɛ nɔɔ nwu aasifiko kabienekɔ di basanko dikudi nwu kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="EST 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 2:10" />Ester ditadiki kale ka otii ku leyo nɔɔ batii kalɔ aata, diekye Mordekai latĩi nwɔ osuku alɛ atambuɛ. <verse eid="EST 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 2:11" />Dii biala Mordekai lakyɛ aatoofe katoo ku kala di basanko dikudi leyo nwu kaflɔnkɔ ɔlɔɔkɔ, alɛ oonyu mmle di Ester nte ni ku nle nikɔbla nwɔ nii.<verse eid="EST 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 2:12" />Fiɛ dibadu ni ɔsankobi biala alɛ aakyɛ ni Ɔka Akasweros nfũ yi, dikpeni anloo lefosi awɛntɛ anyɔ sekpeele sɛsaabla se baatɛ baata ni basanko nwu ɔbla. Awɛntɛ akuɔ di olufui nnɔnyi ofifia suoto, awɛntɛ akuɔ kafɔɔ di nnɔnyi kɔnɔkɔnɔ ku nnɔnyi fifiale ofifia di suoto. <verse eid="EST 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 2:13" />Nnya mmle kafɔɔ di ɔsankobi nwu kamakyɛ ni ɔka nfũ: Lɛsaa lele di ɔsankobi nwu komiɛ yi, mantɔɔ di basanko dikudi nwu kamɛ, anklee ankyɛnko lɛkayo. <verse eid="EST 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 2:14" />Kɔtɔɔfɔ yi, ɔsankobi nwu nkyɛ nfa, olesɛ kafɔɔ ankple ansifi lɛba bamba di basanko dikudi nwu kamɛ di Saasgas kalɔ, nnwɔ niale ni ɔka osuɔtɔ wɔ ataa baadiki ni, aayila ni di ɔka basɔnɔ kanya. Ɔsankobi nwu dilɔbasinkple akyɛ ɔka nfũ, diediki eebuo nwɔ anu ni aabata manlɛɛ ɔsankobi nwu ku leyooto nɔɔ mantɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="EST 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 2:15" />Di obe lawo di Ester, (ɔsankobi wɔ di Mordekai laklee ni, aale ni ote bisɔnle Abihail obisankobi) alɛ aakyɛ ni ɔka nfũ yi, atakaalɛ lɛsalɛsaa dilenkee lɛsaa le di Hegai, nnwɔ niale ni ɔka osuɔtɔ wɔ ataa baadiki ni, aayila ni di basanko dikudi nwu kanya labuɛ nii. Ni di Ester labuo otii biala nianyɔɔ ni anu nɛ. <verse eid="EST 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 2:16" />Ni baakpaa Ester baakyɛnko Ɔka Akasweros di lɛkayo di kɔwɛntɛ fosile kamɛ, kɔwɛntɛ ko manlɛɛ ni Tebet, di Yuda batii awɛntɛ kanya, di sɛka ole nɔɔ lɛlɛɛ kuɛsinle kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="EST 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 2:17" />Ester lalɛ ɔka onyu aalenkee basanko bule, ni aabuo ɔka anu, aafũ nwɔ aakpee, aalenkee kokpeelebitɛ bule nɛ. Nioso aatũkũsa Ester lɛkakoto diisi, aabla nwɔ ɔkasanko di Wasti kanya. <verse eid="EST 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 2:18" />Ninfɛ di ɔka latũ opunu kplɛ, Ester opunu, aata batii finle nɔɔ ku banɔɔfotii bamuu nɛ. Ni di ɔka lata ɔnyɛɛ ɔtɛ di kasɔ nwu kamuu, ni aasɛ akyɛsaa di sɛka kanya nɛ.<verse eid="EST 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mordekai Lafũ Ɔka Nkpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 2:19" />Obe wɔ baasiisa ni kokpeelebitɛ nwu lɛnyɔɔfa yi, Mordekai lasiɛ di ɔka kayoko. <verse eid="EST 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 2:20" />Kafɔɔ Ester layɔ leyo nɔɔ kamɛ ku kale nɔɔ sɛlaa aakookaa fɛ mmle di Mordekai latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ abla nii. Diekye Ester lakple aatikanko Mordekai afiofa fɛ mmle aabla ni di obe wɔ aasiɛ nwɔ ni di ɔkyɛ.<verse eid="EST 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 2:21" />Di obe wɔ kamɛ di Mordekai lasiɛ ni di ɔka kayoko yi, Bigtan ku Teres, niale ni ɔka banɔɔfotii banyɔ ba ninyu ni kayoko osuku lanya ɔblɔ, ni baakũ kanwumbe alɛ babalo Ɔka Akasweros nɛ. <verse eid="EST 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 2:22" />Kafɔɔ Mordekai lawolaa kanwumbe nwu kamɛ, ni aatɔkɔ Ɔkasanko Ester nɛ. Nni kamaa, Ester kafɔɔ latɔkɔ ɔka, ni baayɔ dibu baata Mordekai nɛ. <verse eid="EST 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EST 2:23" />Di obe wɔ baawolaa ni kamɛ, baanya alɛ kute ni nkpo yi, ni baasaka banɔɔfotii nwu banyɔ di kowoso suoto baakpi nɛ. Baakpana sɛlaa se mmle simuu di sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ di ɔka anu.<verse eid="EST 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EST 3" />
  <para style="s1">Haman Lakũ Kanwumbe Alɛ Abawɔɔsa Yuda Batii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 3:1" />Di sɛsaabla se mmle sɛmaa, Ɔka Akasweros lakpee Hamedata, Agagi otii nwu obisuɔtɔbi Haman dibu. Aatakatɛsa nwɔ katoo, aatɔɔ dibu kasiɛkɔ ka niataka katoo kaalenkee ni batii finle bule bamuu. <verse eid="EST 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 3:2" />Ɔka banɔɔfotii bamuu di ɔka kayoko lapɛ akunkyi baata Haman dibu, diekye ɔka niadiki kanya di nle mmle di Haman suoto. Kafɔɔ Mordekai ditapɛ akunkyi ee atɔɔ dibu.<verse eid="EST 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 3:3" />Ninfɛ di ɔka banɔɔfotii nwu di ɔka kayoko kanya lakaalɛ Mordekai alɛ, “Be oso feesĩ ɔka kanya didiki nwu? ” <verse eid="EST 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 3:4" />Dii biala mankakatɛ mantɔɔ, kafɔɔ ansĩ onu. Nkpo oso baatɔkɔ Haman ɔlaa nwu, alɛ boonyu nse abafũ Mordekai nkpa nwu ankpee, diekye aatɔkɔ ma alɛ Yuda otii aale.<verse eid="EST 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 3:5" />Obe wɔ di Haman lanya alɛ Mordekai dilɔɔpɛ akyunkyi ee atɔɔ ni dibu, ni aanya ɔblɔ osie kanya nɛ. <verse eid="EST 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 3:6" />Kafɔɔ di Haman latofo ni batii ba di Mordekai batii lale nii, ni aanyu alɛ Mordekai lete olo dilɔbabla lesalɛsaa. Kafɔɔ Haman lamiɛ osuku wɔ abafe anwɔɔsa ni Mordekai batii bamuu, Yuda batii nwu di Ɔka Akasweros sɛka kalekɔ kamuu kamɛ.<verse eid="EST 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 3:7" />Di Ɔka Akasweros lefosi lɛlɛɛ nyɔɔfa, di kɔwɛntɛ kasale kamɛ, kule ni Nisan, di Yuda batii awɛntɛ kanya yi, baawii <char style="tl">pur</char> (nni ninle atrebi owii) di Haman anu alɛ boodiki dii ku kɔwɛntɛ nɛ. Ni di atrebi owii nwu lase di lefosi kɔwɛntɛ nyɔɔfa, bɔɔlɛɛ ni Adar, di Yuda batii kɔwɛntɛ kanya nɛ.<verse eid="EST 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 3:8" />Ninfɛ di Haman latɔkɔ Ɔka Akasweros alɛ, “Batii bawo nkpe bɛɛsamii bakpete ni di sɛka kalekɔ lɛfɔ kasɔ kamuu suoto, di sɛsaabla lɛma lekyi ni lete di batii bule bamuu sele suoto, nioso boloole ɔka afiofa; diele kafɔɔ lɛsaa biene diɛta ni ɔka alɛ aafũ ma ankpee nii. <verse eid="EST 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 3:9" />Nse dilɛ dita ɔka, ni aata bakpee kufiofa baawɔɔsa ma. Ni ami kamayɔ koto fututu bakilo nkpe alafa-atiɛ-afosi-anɔɔ di ɔka koto katɛkɔ nta otii wɔ nimabla ni ɔkpɛ wɔ mmle.”<verse eid="EST 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 3:10" />Nioso ɔka ladiki lɛkɔnii le di leyooto nɔɔ ntika ni di lɛnɛɛbi nɔɔ, ni aayɔ ni aata Hamedata, Agagi otii nwu obisuɔtɔbi, Haman, niale ni Yuda batii lo nɛ. <verse eid="EST 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 3:11" />Ni di ɔka latɔkɔ Haman alɛ, “Yɔ koto nwu fatɛ, faabla batii nwu fɛ mmle dikaatɛ fɔ ni.”<verse eid="EST 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 3:12" />Ninfɛ di lefosi dii tiɛfa di kɔwɛntɛ kasale suoto, ni baalɛɛ ɔka akũ bakpanatɛ nɛ. Baakpana sĩ di kasɔ biala kɔkpana ku batii biala sele kamɛ ku Haman afiofa amuu aata ɔka kanyabayilatɛ, nsɔ nwu ateate batunletɛ ku batii nwu ateate batii finle. Baakpana n-ya mmle di Ɔka Akasweros omu leyooto kanya, baatĩi kanya ku lɛkɔnii nɔɔ nimu. <verse eid="EST 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 3:13" />Baakpee atɔbakyɛntɛ baayɔ akũ nwu baakyɛnko ɔka kasɔ nwu kamuu ku kufiofa alɛ babalo, manwɔɔsa, mandiki kafɔɔ Yuda batii bamuu- bakosopo ku banɔɔfo, basanko ku babisɔ biibii- di dii ninwii kamɛ, di lefosi dii tiɛfa suoto di lefosi kɔwɛntɛ nyɔɔfa, bɔɔlɛɛ ni Adar, manlɛ asaa lɛma mansifiko. <verse eid="EST 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 3:14" />Baadiki kukũ nwu kamɛ sɛlaa baabla fɛ kufiofa di kasɔ biala baata kale biala batii latofo di mmle babalolaa suoto manta ni dii nwu.<verse eid="EST 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 3:15" />Nfanwu, di ɔka nwu kanya didiki yi, kɔtɔbakyɛntɛ nwu ladie baasifi, ni baakpee kufiofa nwu di Susa katanikokɔ nwu nɛ. Ni di ɔka ku Haman lasiɛ alɛ boonyi nta, kafɔɔ Susa okpoo kplɛ labuo kudú.<verse eid="EST 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EST 4" />
  <para style="s1">Mordekai Lakaalɛ Lɛkyakaako Aakyeko Ester Ɔkyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 4:1" />Obe wɔ di Mordekai latofo ni asaa ya amuu batɔɔbla nii, ni aabɛbɛɛ akpeele nɔɔ, aayɔ lɛboko aanyukũ, aayɔ ntɔ̀ aafifia, ni aadie aasifi okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ aalaatoowi kaku osie kanya ku kudú nɛ. <verse eid="EST 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 4:2" />Kafɔɔ ɔka kayoko lete aakyɛ aalaase, diekye osuku nnaa kuɔta otii kuonwii alɛ aaklee leboko ambuo nwu. <verse eid="EST 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 4:3" />Di kasɔ ka biala di kukũ nwu ku ɔka kanya didiki nwu lakyɛ ni yi, kaku kplɛ nwɛ di Yuda batii kamɛ, ku kanya ninii, kaku owi ku kudú. Batii kpinwu laklee aboko baate di ntɔ̀ kamɛ.<verse eid="EST 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 4:4" />Obe wɔ di Ester bakpɛmblatɛ-sanko ku basuɔtɔ ba ataa beediki ni lawa baabatɔkɔ nwɔ ni Mordekai ɔlaa yi, diabuo nwɔ suoto osie kanya. Ni di Ester layɔ akpeele aakyesee Mordekai alɛ akpee, aadiki leboko nɔɔ nwu atɛ, kafɔɔ atafũ nya. <verse eid="EST 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 4:5" />Ninfɛ di Ester lalɛɛ Hatak, ɔka osuɔtɔ wɔ beediki ni ataa, baadiki alɛ atoonyu nwɔ nii, ni aatɔkɔ osuɔtɔ nwu alɛ awolaa kamɛ di lɛsaa le nikɔbla ni Mordekai ku nle oso diɛwa ni ninkpo.<verse eid="EST 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 4:6" />Nioso Hatak ladie aakyɛ Mordekai nfũ di okpoo kplɛ nwu lɛkpaka di ɔka kayoko. <verse eid="EST 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 4:7" />Ni di Mordekai latɔkɔ Hatak lɛsaa biala le niawa nwɔ ni di suoto, ku koto ko okle di Haman labuɛ aatɛ alɛ abayɔ antɛ ni di ɔka koto katɛkɔ, diɛta ni Yuda batii ɔwɔɔsa nkyaka nii. <verse eid="EST 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 4:8" />Aatɔɔ kafɔɔ kukũ nwu sɛlaa diɛta ni otososa odiki lɛma wɔ baakpana ni di Susa, alɛ aalaatuo Ester aadiki kũ kamɛ atɔɔ. Aatɔkɔ nwɔ kafɔɔ alɛ atɔkɔ Ester aakyɛ ɔka katũ aalaatikiti nwɔ lekoto aanya ma nyaami, aatikiti nwɔ lekoto kafɔɔ ata batii nɔɔ. <verse eid="EST 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 4:9" />Ni di Hatak lakple aasifi aalaatɔkɔ Ester ɔlaa wɔ di Mordekai labuɛ ni nɛ. <verse eid="EST 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 4:10" />Ninfɛ di Ester latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ aalaatɔkɔ Mordekai alɛ, <verse eid="EST 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 4:11" />“Ɔka banɔɔfotii bamuu ku ɔka nsɔ nwu batii n-ye alɛ osuɔtɔ ee ɔsanko lele niɛwa ɔka ɔkyɛ di leyo le kaamɛ kamɛ, ninanle ɔlɛɛ ɛɛlɛɛ nwɔ yi, ɔka nkpe kufiofa kunwii pɛ: alɛ baalo otii nwu. Nle lete niedie ni kaamɛ ninle alɛ, ɔka mayɔ koto sɛɛle lɛkɔ ankyɔɔ otii nwu, ninfũ nwɔ nkpa nɛ. Kafɔɔ ayi afosi-atiɛ nintoofe, bɛɛlɛɛ mi alɛ nkyɛ ni ɔka nfũ nɛ.”<verse eid="EST 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 4:12" />Obe wɔ baalaatɔkɔ ni Mordekai Ester sɛlaa nwu yi, <verse eid="EST 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 4:13" />ni di Mordekai lakplesa kanya ka mmle alɛ: “Tannyu falɛ, ta fasi ni di ɔka leyo oso, lete lɛfɔ nimadie di Yuda batii bamuu kamɛ. <verse eid="EST 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 4:14" />Diekye nse feelokanana di obe wɔ mmle kamɛ, ni lɛkyakaako ku didiki kamakye lɛba bamba ninta Yuda batii, kafɔɔ afɔ ku teefɔ leyo kamɛ batii kamakpi. Owe kafɔɔ nin-ye alɛ afɔ faawa sɛka kayilakɔ ka mmle di obe wɔ mmle okle kamɛ?”<verse eid="EST 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 4:15" />Ninfɛ di Ester lakyesee Mordekai kanya didikibi le mmle alɛ: <verse eid="EST 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 4:16" />“Tɔɔkyɛ faalaasiisa Yuda batii ba bamuu ninkpe ni di Susa, bienii kanya bitɛɛ. Bitanle ee bianyi ayi atiɛ, kakũ ee kakyɛ. Ami ku bakpɛmblatɛ-sanko nii bubanii kanya fɛ mmle biɔbla nii. Nse butɔɔbla nle mmle, ami kamakyɛ ɔka nfũ, nu di kufiofa diɛta osuku. Ni nse lekpi, ntookpi.”<verse eid="EST 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 4:17" />Nioso Mordekai lakyɛ aasifi aalaabla di Ester sɛlaa simuu kanya.<verse eid="EST 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EST 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ester Lalɛɛ Ɔka Ku Haman Aawako Opunu Wɔ Aatũ Nii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 5:1" />Di dii tiɛfa suoto, Ester lakpee akasaa nɔɔ, aayila di lɛkayo kaflɔnkɔ ka kaamɛ kamɛ di ɔka lɛkpata anu. Ɔka lasiɛ di lɛkakpomii nɔɔ suoto di lɛkpata nwu, aakyɔɔ anu kayoko. <verse eid="EST 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 5:2" />Obe wɔ di ɔka lanya ni Ɔkasanko Ester layila ni di kaflɔnkɔ nwu yi, aabuo nwɔ anu, ni di ɔka layɔ koto sɛɛle lɛkɔ nwu di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ aakyɔɔ Ester nɛ. Nioso Ester lakyɛ aalaakpanko lɛkɔ nwu ɔnya.<verse eid="EST 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 5:3" />Ninfɛ di ɔka lakaalɛ alɛ, “Ɔkasanko Ester, obe dile? Obe ninle fɔ dibiesaa? Bia diedu ni sɛka kalekɔ kakyɛ yi, babayɔ manta fɔ.”<verse eid="EST 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 5:4" />Ni di Ester ladiki kanya alɛ, “Nse dilɛ diɛta ɔka, ni ta ɔka ku Haman bawa opunu wɔ letũ ni miɛ lɛta fɔ ni.”<verse eid="EST 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 5:5" />Ni di ɔka labuɛ alɛ, “Lɛɛ Haman fawako wla, di mmle buabla ni lesaa le di Ester lɛkaalɛ ni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 5:5">Nioso ɔka ku Haman lakyɛ opunu wɔ di Ester latũ nii. <verse eid="EST 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 5:6" />Di obe wɔ baatoonyi ni nta, ɔka lakple aakaalɛ Ester alɛ, “Kanunua obe fɔɔkaalɛ? Babayɔ manta fɔ. Obe lɛsaa ninle fɔ dibiesaa? Bia diɛlaadu ni sɛka kalekɔ nii kakyɛ yi, babatuna manta fɔ.”<verse eid="EST 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 5:7" />Ni di Ester ladiki kanya alɛ, “Dibiesaa nii ku nle kɔkaalɛ ni ninle nle mmle nɛ: <verse eid="EST 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 5:8" />Nse ɔka nle mi sibualɛ ku dibu, dilɛ kafɔɔ diɛta ɔka alɛ aatuna di dibiesaa nii, aambla kafɔɔ di nle kɔkaalɛ nii yi, ni ta ɔka ku Haman bawa opunu wɔ kamatũ nta ma ni kɔsɛɛ. Ni kamadiki kanya di ɔka sɛlaa kaalɛle suoto.”<verse eid="EST 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Haman Lakũ Kanwumbe Alɛ Oolo Mordekai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 5:9" />Dii nwu Haman ladie ninfa ku suoto lɛyɔɔ ku lɛpɔ osie kanya. Kafɔɔ obe wɔ aanya ni Mordekai di ɔka kayoko, aatofo alɛ atataka ee atayɛkɛ ni di anu nɔɔ yi, ɔblɔ lafiɛ Haman di Mordekai suoto. <verse eid="EST 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 5:10" />Kafɔɔ, Haman lamufũ suoto aaklee, ni aasifi leyo nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 5:10">Ni aakpee baalɛɛ basiɛwo nɔɔ ku ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ Seres nɛ. <verse eid="EST 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 5:11" />Ni di Haman latakatɛsa suoto katoo aatuo ma di lɛsaawɛ kplɛ nɔɔ suoto, babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ kpinwu ku sisuku se simuu se suoto di ɔka latɔɔ ni dibu ku mmle aatakatɛsa nwɔ ni katoo alenke ni batii finle ku banɔɔfotii bamba nɛ. <verse eid="EST 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 5:12" />Haman lakple aabuɛ aakyakaa alɛ, “Diele simuu nɛ, lete nii ninle otii wɔ di Ɔkasanko Ester lalɛɛ alɛ ntikanko ni ɔka buɔwa ni opunu wɔ aatũ ni nɛ. Ester lakple aalɛɛ mi ku ɔka kafɔɔ alɛ buwa kɔsɛɛ. <verse eid="EST 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 5:13" />Kafɔɔ n-ya mmle amuu dilɔɔtɛɛ suoto leyɔɔ kokple nnya ni ɔnya Mordekai, Yuda otii nwu ninsi ni di ɔka kayoko.”<verse eid="EST 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 5:14" />Ni di Haman basiɛwo nɔɔ bamuu ku ɔsɔfɔ Seres latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Ta batofo lɛkpaka di lɛtaka dibla nkpaa afosi-akuɛnsĩ-nnɔɔ, faatɔkɔ ɔka, aata basaka Mordekai di lɛkpaka nwu ku olesɛ. Fiɛ nfɛ fakyɛ alesaa nwu kalekɔ ku ɔka di suoto siyɔɔ fɔ.” Haman lafũ ɔlaa wɔ mmle aakpee, ni aata baatofo lɛkpaka nwu baase nɛ.<verse eid="EST 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EST 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔka Lata Mordekai Dibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 6:1" />Kakyɛ nwu, ɔka ditafuo ɔkyɔsĩi; nioso aata baayɔ sekofolaa kukũ, sɛka ole nɔɔ sɛlaa bɛɛkpana bɛɛtɛ nii baawako, ni aata baaka baatɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="EST 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 6:2" />Baanya alɛ baakpana ninfa alɛ Mordekai ladiki Bigtana ku Teres kalɔ, ɔka banɔɔfotii ba banyɔ ba niatoonyu ni kayoko, baakũ ni kanwumbe alɛ boolo ni Ɔka Akasweros.<verse eid="EST 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 6:3" />Ni di ɔka lakaalɛ alɛ, “Lɛmɛmbu ku nsũ lɛtɛsaa di Mordekai ntoofũ di nle mmle suoto?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 6:3">Ni di bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ ladiki kanya alɛ, “Badibla lɛsalɛsaa batɔɔ.”<verse eid="EST 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 6:4" />Ni di ɔka lakaalɛ alɛ, “Owe ninkpe di kaflɔnkɔ nwu?” Obe nwu di Haman labuo obuo di lɛkayo nwu kaflɔnkɔ alɛ ɔɔkakatɛko ɔka di Mordekai ɔsaka di lɛkpaka le eetofo ɛɛtɔɔ ni suoto nɛ.<verse eid="EST 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 6:5" />Ni di bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ ladiki kanya alɛ, “Haman nin-yɛ di kaflɔnkɔ nwu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 6:5">Ni di ɔka labuɛ alɛ, “Bikpaa nwɔ biwako.”<verse eid="EST 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 6:6" />Di Haman labuo nii, ɔka lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Obe baabla bata otii wɔ dilɛ diɛta ni ɔka alɛ aata ni dibu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 6:6">Ninfɛ di Haman labu nwu di suoto nɔɔ kamɛ alɛ, “Ni owe ninkpe di ɔka kamata dibu ninanle ami?” <verse eid="EST 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 6:7" />Nioso aatɔkɔ ɔka alɛ, “Di otii wɔ dilɛ diɛta ni ɔka alɛ ɔɔta ni dibu yi, <verse eid="EST 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 6:8" />ta ma bawako akasaa ya di ɔka ntoodiklee ni ku pɔnkɔ wɔ suoto di ɔka ntodisiɛ ni, nnwɔ di ɔka nsũ lɛtɛsaa ntika ni di disi nɔɔ suoto. <verse eid="EST 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 6:9" />Ni faata bayɔ akpeele ku pɔnkɔ nwu bakpee di ɔka ɔnɔɔfotii finle wɔ niɛtaka katoo alenke ni nnɛɛ. Faata ma baklɛɛ otii wɔ dilɛ diɛta ni ɔka alɛ aata ni dibu, baakpaa nwɔ di pɔnkɔ nwu suoto bakyiko okpoo kplɛ nwu akpaka, baatoobuɛ di anu nɔɔ alɛ, ‘Nnya lɛsaa le bɛɛbla bɛɛta ni otii wɔ dilɛ diɛta ni ɔka alɛ ɔɔta ni dibu!’ ”<verse eid="EST 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 6:10" />Ni di ɔka ladiki Haman kanya alɛ, “Kyɛ wla faalaayɔ akpeele ku pɔnkɔ nwu, faabla fɛ mmle feebuɛ ni fata Mordekai, Yuda otii nwu, nnwɔ ninsiɛ ni di ɔka kayoko. Tansĩ lɛsalɛsaa, di n-ya feebuɛ ni kamɛ ɔbla.”<verse eid="EST 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 6:11" />Nioso Haman layɔ akpeele ku pɔnkɔ nwu. Ni aaklɛɛ Mordekai, aatika nwɔ di pɔnkɔ kamaa aakyiko okpoo kplɛ nwu akpaka, aatoobuɛ di anu nɔɔ alɛ, “Nnya lɛsaa le bɛɛbla bɛɛta ni otii wɔ dilɛ diɛta ni ɔka alɛ ɔɔta ni dibu!”<verse eid="EST 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 6:12" />Nni sɛmaa, Mordekai lakple aasifi ɔka kayoko. Kafɔɔ Haman latoso aasifi leyo, aakpee disi kaasɔ ku sɛnyaami, <verse eid="EST 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 6:13" />ni aalaatɔkɔ basiɛwo nɔɔ bamuu ku ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ Seres lɛsaa biala le niawa nwɔ ni di suoto nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 6:13">Ni di mba niaka nwɔ ni ku ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ Seres latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Di obe wɔ di Mordekai wɔ anu di kasɔ lɛfɔ ɔpɛ ntookye ni kasɔ nle ni Yuda kale otii yi, flɔbafuo ɔtaka oyila nwɔ di suoto- nwaako fɔɔwa ɔbawɔɔ!” <verse eid="EST 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 6:14" />Obe wɔ beekple bɔɔkakatɛ ni ku nnwɔɔ, ni di ɔka basuɔtɔ ba beediki ni ataa lawa baabakpaa Haman wla baasifiko Ester opunu wɔ aatũ ni nɛ.<verse eid="EST 6:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EST 7" />
  <para style="s1">Baasaka Haman Baalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 7:1" />Nioso ɔka ku Haman lakyɛ baalaale alesaa ku Ɔkasanko Ester. <verse eid="EST 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 7:2" />Di obe wɔ baatoonyi ni nta di dii nyɔɔfa nwu suoto yi, ɔka lakple aakaalɛ alɛ, “Ɔkasanko Ester, obe ninle lɛsaa le fɔɔkaalɛ ni? Babayɔ manta fɔ. Obe ninle fɔ dibiesaa? Bia diɛlaadu ni sɛka kalekɔ nii kakyɛ yi, babayɔ manta fɔ.”<verse eid="EST 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 7:3" />Ninfɛ di Ɔkasanko Ester ladiki kanya alɛ, “Oo ɔka, nse fabale mi sibualɛ, nse kafɔɔ dilɛ diɛta afɔ ɔka yi, ni tɛɛ nsiɛ nkpa- nle mmle ninle lɛsaa le kɔkaalɛ ni nɛ. Faata kafɔɔ batii nii basiɛ nkpa- nle mmle ninle dibiesaa nii nɛ. <verse eid="EST 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 7:4" />Diekye batoosunsũ ami ku batii nii bɛɛta kawɔɔ ku olo ku otososa odiki di kasɔ nwu suoto. Nse fɛ osunsũ lete mansunsũ wo fɛ osuɔtɔ ku ɔsanko balanle yi, nse ntabalokanana, diekye diele nimiina le mmle okle dikaatɛ baakpee ni ɔka kubuɛ.”<verse eid="EST 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 7:5" />Ni di Ɔka Akasweros lakaalɛ Ɔkasanko Ester alɛ, “Owe dile? Ɔfɛ di otii wɔ dikle ni ɔkɔnsɔ alɛ ɔɔbla ni lɛsaa le mmle okle nkpe?”<verse eid="EST 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 7:6" />Ni di Ester labuɛ alɛ, “Kyiditɛ ku lo nwu ninle Haman kpiletɛ wɔ mmle nɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 7:6">Ninfɛ di difu lapɛ Haman di ɔka ku ɔkasanko nwu anu nɛ. <verse eid="EST 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 7:7" />Ni di ɔka lataka ku ɔblɔ, aadiɛ nta nɔɔ, aasifi lɛkayo nwu kɔba kamɛ. Kafɔɔ di Haman latofo alɛ ɔka ntoodiki ni kɔkpaa nɔɔ kofokofoko yi, aakple aasiɛ sɛɛmaa aatootikiti Ɔkasanko lekoto di nkpa nɔɔ disi.<verse eid="EST 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 7:8" />Nfanwu di ɔka lakye lɛkayo kɔba akple aawa ni opunu otũ lɛkpata nwu, aanya alɛ Haman latɔɔwakasɔ di nfũ di Ester lasiɛ nii.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 7:8">Ni di ɔka lafaa aabuɛ alɛ, “Ɔɔbatenko bia ɔkasanko, di obe wɔ akpe ni di ɔkyɛ nii, di leyo kamɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 7:8">Nfanwu di ɔlaa ladie odie di ɔka kanya, ni baatĩi Haman anu nɛ. <verse eid="EST 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 7:9" />Ninfɛ di Harbona, ɔka osuɔtɔ onwii wɔ baadiki ni ataa nintoonyu ni ɔka labuɛ alɛ, “Lɛkpaka le niɛtaka ni nkpaa afosi-akuɛnsĩ-nnɔɔ n-yɛ di Haman leyo. Nle aabla aata ni Mordekai wɔ niakakatɛ aafũ ni ɔka nkpa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 7:9">Ni di ɔka labuɛ alɛ, “Bisaka Haman di lɛkpaka nwu suoto!” <verse eid="EST 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 7:10" />Nioso baasaka Haman baalo di lɛkpaka le aabla aata ni Mordekai. Ninfɛ di ɔka ɔblɔ layɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="EST 7:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EST 8" />
  <para style="s1">Baatɔkɔ Yuda Batii Alɛ Bakpɛ Badiki Oko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 8:1" />Di dii nwu nkpo kale, Ɔka Akasweros layɔ Haman, Yuda batii lo, leyo aata Ɔkasanko Ester. Ni di Mordekai lawa ɔka anu nɛ, diekye Ester latɔkɔ nwɔ mmle di kɔna nɔɔ nte ni ku Mordekai. <verse eid="EST 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 8:2" />Ni di ɔka ladiki lɛnɛɛbi nɔɔ lɛkɔnii le aaklee aafũ ni di Haman nfũ, ni aayɔ ni aata Mordekai nɛ. Ninfɛ di Ester layɔ Mordekai aase di Haman lɛsaawɛ kanya nɛ.<verse eid="EST 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 8:3" />Ni di Ester lakple aatikiti ɔka lekoto, aatɔɔpɛ akunkyi di nkpaatũ nɔɔ, aatoowi kaku nɛ. Aatikiti ɔka lekoto alɛ ata Haman, Agagi otii nwu kɔkpaa didiki kpile nwu kuloo, di nle aatɛ alɛ ababla ni di Yuda batii suoto. <verse eid="EST 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 8:4" />Ninfɛ di ɔka layɔ koto sɛɛle lɛkɔ nwu aakyɔɔ Ester, ni aataka aabayila di ɔka anu nɛ.<verse eid="EST 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 8:5" />Ni di Ester labuɛ alɛ, “Nse dilɛ diɛta ɔka, eebu mi, eele mi sibualɛ kafɔɔ, eenyu alɛ dile lɛsaa biene aabla nii, ni nse lebuo nwɔ anu yi, ni faata kanya didiki, baakpana baakyisa akũ ya di Hamedata obisuɔtɔbi, Haman, Agagi otii nwu kɔkpaa didiki kpile le aakpana alɛ bawɔɔsa ni Yuda batii di ɔka nsɔ nwu mmuu batɛ di ɔlɔɔkɔ. <verse eid="EST 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 8:6" />Diekye lɛ nfɛ kafuo otu okpee nnyu ɔlaa kpile ntũ batii nii? Lɛ nfɛ kakpee otu nnya leyo nii batii kawɔɔ?”<verse eid="EST 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 8:7" />Ni di Ɔka Akasweros ladiki kanya di Ɔkasanko Ester ku Mordekai, Yuda otii nwu ɔlaa suoto alɛ, “Ta nle di Haman ladieko ni Yuda batii oso ntɔɔyɔ lɛsaawɛ nɔɔ lɛta Ester, ni batɔɔsaka Haman beelo nɛ. <verse eid="EST 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 8:8" />Kanunua kpana kufiofa bamba, di ɔka leyooto kamɛ, di Yuda batii kanya, fɛ mmle feenyu falɛ dikaatɛko fɔ ni, faatĩi kukũ nwu kanya ku ɔka lɛnɛɛbi lɛkɔnii- diekye kukũ ku kuonwii nnaa bɛɛkpana ni di ɔka leyooto kamɛ, beetĩi ni kanya ku lɛkɔnii nɔɔ kakple kumbla ni ɔkpɛ.”<verse eid="EST 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 8:9" />Nfanwu ni baalɛɛ ɔka akũ bakpanatɛ- di ayi afosi-anyɔ-dii tiɛfa suoto di kɔwɛntɛ tiɛfa manlɛɛ ni Siwan di Yuda batii awɛntɛ kanya nɛ. Baakpana Mordekai afiofa amuu baata Yuda batii ku ɔka banɔɔfotii, abaa kanyabayilatɛ ku nsɔ nwu kɔlafa-afosi-anyɔ-nkuɛnsĩ batii finle, diayɔ ni di India dialaadu ni Kus kasɔ. Baakpana afiofa ya mmle di kasɔ biala kɔkpana ku batii biala sele kamɛ, ku Yuda batii kafɔɔ di mma bamu kɔkpana ku sele kamɛ. <verse eid="EST 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 8:10" />Mordekai lakpana nya di Ɔka Akasweros leyooto kamɛ, aatĩi akũ nwu kanya ku ɔka lɛnɛɛbi lɛkɔnii, ni aayɔ nya aata atɔbakyɛntɛ ba ninsiɛ ni bapɔnkɔ ba ninkpe ni sɛwa, kyenkye mba baase baata ni ɔka.<verse eid="EST 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 8:11" />Ɔka kukũ nwu lata Yuda batii di okpoo kplɛ biala osuku alɛ basi, baatĩtĩi suoto lɛma; baalo, baawɔɔsa, baatososa kafɔɔ kale lele bakpɛtɛ ee kasɔ ka batii nimamiɛ alɛ boodieko ma ni ku basanko lɛma ku babi lɛma; alɛ baayɔ balo lɛma kakpɛ kamɛ lɛsaawɛ. <verse eid="EST 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 8:12" />Dii le baatɛ ni Yuda batii alɛ baabla ni nle mmle di Ɔka Akasweros kasɔ kamuu niale lefosi dii tiɛfa di lefosi kɔwɛntɛ nyɔɔfa, bɔɔlɛɛ ni Adar, di Yuda batii awɛntɛ kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="EST 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 8:13" />Baadiki kukũ nwu kamɛ sɛlaa baabla fɛ kufiofa di kasɔ biala baata kale biala batii latofo, di mmle di Yuda batii kamalolaa suoto manta ni dii nwu, di ɔbla okyisa ɔta ni suoto lɛma di balo lɛma suoto.<verse eid="EST 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 8:14" />Nioso di ɔka kanya didiki yi, atɔbakyɛntɛ nwu lasiɛ ɔka bapɔnkɔ baatoso baakyɛ kɔtɔ nwu. Baasɛ kafɔɔ akũ nwu di Susa katanikokɔ nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="EST 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 8:15" />Ninfɛ di Mordekai lakyɛ di ɔka anu nɛ, aakpee ɔka akpeele ya niate ni bluu ku fututu, aatũkũ koto sɛɛle lɛkakoto ku dibula biene fɛnɛnɛɛ akpeele ya niɛbla ni fɛ ɔsɛɛ. Ni di Susa okpoo kplɛ nwu batii lale suoto lɛyɔɔ dii nɛ. <verse eid="EST 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 8:16" />Di obe nwu kamɛ diabla suoto lɛyɔɔ, lɛpɔ́, lɛmɛnɛfɛsaa ku dibu diata Yuda batii. <verse eid="EST 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 8:17" />Di kasɔ biala suoto ku okpoo kplɛ biala kamɛ, kakɔ lele di ɔka kukũ nwu lakyɛ, suoto lɛyɔɔ ku lɛpɔ́ lawɛ di Yuda batii kamɛ ku ole ku onyi sɛsaabla. Nioso nnle bamba batii kpinwu labakple Yuda batii, diekye baatɔɔyɛkɛ Yuda batii nwu.<verse eid="EST 8:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EST 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda Batii Lawɔɔsa Balo Lɛma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 9:1" />Di lefosi dii tiɛfa di lefosi kɔwɛntɛ nyɔɔfa, bɔɔlɛɛ ni Adar, di Yuda batii awɛntɛ kamɛ, fiɛ di kukũ ko di ɔka ladiki ni kanya kabla ɔkpɛ. Di dii le mmle suoto Yuda batii balo lanyu alɛ babalenkee Yuda batii, kafɔɔ nyu lo, ɔlaa nwu lakyi kuafuu, ni di Yuda batii lalenkee mba niakyidi ma ni nɛ. <verse eid="EST 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 9:2" />Ninfɛ di Yuda batii lasi di sekpoo kplɛ lɛma, di Ɔka Akasweros kasɔ kamuu suoto alɛ bɔɔlaadieko mba niatoomiɛ ni kawɔɔ lɛma nɛ. Kuonwii ditafuo ma oyilako, diekye nnle bamba nwu batii bamuu latɔɔyɛkɛ ma. <verse eid="EST 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 9:3" />Ni di nsɔ nwu batii finle bamuu, ɔka banɔɔfotii ku abaa kanyabayilatɛ ku ɔka kanyabayilatɛ lakyakaako Yuda batii nɛ, ta Mordekai difu lapɛ ma ni oso. <verse eid="EST 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 9:4" />Mordekai lale otii finle di lɛkayo nwu kamɛ; leyooto nɔɔ lakyaka nsɔ nwu mmuu, ni aakple aawɛ osie aatɔɔkyakaa nɛ.<verse eid="EST 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 9:5" />Nioso Yuda batii lasasafɔ balo lɛma bamuu ku kapamii, baaloloo ma, baawɔɔsa ma, ni baabla ma nle niakaatɛɛko ma ni nɛ. <verse eid="EST 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 9:6" />Di Susa katanikokɔ kamɛ, Yuda batii nwu lalo, baawɔɔsa batii alafa-anɔɔ. <verse eid="EST 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 9:7" />Baalo kafɔɔ Parsandata, Dalfon, Aspata, <verse eid="EST 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 9:8" />Porata, Adalia, Aridata, <verse eid="EST 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 9:9" />Parmasta, Arisai, Aridai ku Waisata, <verse eid="EST 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 9:10" />Hamedata obisuɔtɔbi, Haman babisɔtɔbi lefosi nwu niale ni Yuda batii balo. Kafɔɔ batadiki nnɛɛ baakpanko kakpɛ lɛsaawɛ lɛma.<verse eid="EST 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 9:11" />Baalaatɔkɔ ɔka batii ba lɛpɔ le baalo ni di Susa katanikokɔ nwu kamɛ di dii nwu nkpo kale. <verse eid="EST 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 9:12" />Ni di ɔka latɔkɔ Ɔkasanko Ester alɛ, “Yuda batii ntoolo, bɛɛwɔɔsa kafɔɔ batii alafa-anɔɔ ku Haman babisuɔtɔbi lefosi nwu di Susa katanikokɔ nwu kamɛ. Ni lɛ bɛɛbla di ɔka nsɔ nwu bule kamɛ? Kanunua be lɛsaa nfɛ fɔɔkaalɛ? Bababla manta fɔ. Obe ninle fɔ dibiesaa? Nni kafɔɔ babatuna manta fɔ.”<verse eid="EST 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 9:13" />Ninfɛ di Ester ladiki kanya alɛ, “Nse dilɛ diɛta ɔka, ni aata Yuda batii ba di Susa osuku baabla miɛ dii le mmle kukũ nwu ɔkpɛ kɔsɛɛ kafɔɔ, faata basaka Haman babisuɔtɔbi lefosi nwu di akpaka suoto.”<verse eid="EST 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 9:14" />Nioso ɔka ladiki kanya alɛ babla nninkpo. Baakpana kukũ di Susa, ni baasaka Haman babisuɔtɔbi lefosi nwu baalo nɛ. <verse eid="EST 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 9:15" />Ni di Yuda batii ba di Susa labasi di Adar kɔwɛntɛ lefosi dii naafa suoto, ni baalo batii alafa-atiɛ di Susa nɛ, kafɔɔ batadiki nnɛɛ baakpanko kakpɛ lɛsaawɛ lɛma.<verse eid="EST 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 9:16" />Kafɔɔ di obe nwu kamɛ Yuda batii ba niabu ni di ɔka nsɔ nwu suoto kafɔɔ lasi baatĩtĩi suoto lɛma alɛ baawɛ onwu mannwuna di balo lɛma nnɛɛ. Baalo batii nkpe afosi-akuɛnsĩ-banɔɔ lɛma, kafɔɔ batadiki nnɛɛ baakpanko kakpɛ lɛsaawɛ lɛma. <verse eid="EST 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 9:17" />Nle mmle lawa di Adar kɔwɛntɛ lefosi dii tiɛfa suoto, ni di lefosi dii naafa suoto baatɛ ɔnyɛɛ, baatũ opunu, baanya suoto lɛyɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="EST 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Purim Dii Ole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 9:18" />Kafɔɔ Yuda batii ba di Susa lasi di lefosi dii tiɛfa ku lefosi dii naafa suoto, ninfɛ baatɛ ɔnyɛɛ di lefosi dii nɔɔnle suoto nɛ, baatũ opunu baanya suoto lɛyɔɔ.<verse eid="EST 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 9:19" />Nioso di Yuda batii ba ninsi ni di sɛkpoo kplɛ- ku mba ninsi ni di sekpoo biibii- n-le dii di Adar kɔwɛntɛ lefosi dii naafa suoto, fɛ suoto lɛyɔɔ ku opunu otũ dii nɛ, dii le manta ni bawo asaa.<verse eid="EST 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 9:20" />Ninfɛ di Mordekai lakpana sɛsaabla se mmle aatɛ, ni aakpana akũ aata Yuda batii ba di Ɔka Akasweros nsɔ mmuu, mbe niatɛɛtɛɛ ni ku mbe niakyo nii, <verse eid="EST 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 9:21" />alɛ aata ma manle lefosi dii naafa ku lefosi dii nɔɔnle ayi nwu lɛlɛɛ biala di Adar kɔwɛntɛ kamɛ nɛ, <verse eid="EST 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 9:22" />fɛ obe wɔ di Yuda batii lawɛ ni atoko ɔkyɛ ole di balo lɛma nnɛɛ ku kɔwɛntɛ ko di sɛnyaami lɛma owi lakple ni suoto lɛyɔɔ, di kaku lɛma kafɔɔ owi labakple ni dii ole. Mordekai lakpana nya alɛ baale ayi ya mmle fɛ opunu otũ ku suoto lɛyɔɔ ayi ku bawo alesaa ɔta ku asaa ɔkyɛ bapiitɛ.<verse eid="EST 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EST 9:23" />Nioso Yuda batii nwu lafũ baakpee alɛ babakple mantoole ayi nwu baakye ni kasɔ ole, mantɔɔbla asaa ya di Mordekai lakpana aata ma nii. <verse eid="EST 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EST 9:24" />Diekye Hamedata, Agagi otii nwu obisuɔtɔbi, Haman, Yuda batii bamuu lo nwu lakũ kanwumbe di Yuda batii suoto alɛ abawɔɔsa ma, ni aawii <char style="tl">pur</char> (nin ninle atrebi owii) diata ni olo lɛma ku kawɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="EST 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EST 9:25" />Kafɔɔ di obe wɔ di ɔka lanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">di obe wɔ di Ester lakyɛ ni ɔka katũ</char></note> ni kanwumbe nwu okũ ɔlaa, ni aakpana afiofa kukũ alɛ kɔkpaa kpile ko di Haman kodiki ni di Yuda batii suoto kakple kunwa di nnwɔɔ omu disi suoto, alɛ nnwɔɔ ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ baasaka ma di akpaka suoto. <verse eid="EST 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EST 9:26" />(Nkpo oso baatɔɔlɛɛ ayi ya mmle alɛ Purim, diakye di <char style="tl">pur.</char> ɔlaa suoto). Ta lɛsaa biala baakpana ni di kukũ ko mmle kamɛ ku nle baanya ni ku nle niawa ma ni di suoto oso. <verse eid="EST 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EST 9:27" />Ni di Yuda batii layɔ baatika di suoto lɛma alɛ bɔɔtɛ ɔsaabla wɔ di mma ku banantii lɛma ku mba bamuu niakpɔtɔɔ ma ni kaamɛ, batansĩ ayi anyɔ ya mmle ole lɛlɛɛ biala, di osuku wɔ kanya baakyɛ ni ku obe wɔ baatɛ ni kamɛ. <verse eid="EST 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EST 9:28" />Dikpe ni manyuma, manle kafɔɔ ayi ya mmle di leyo biala kamɛ, kɔna biala kamɛ ku kasɔ biala ku okpoo kplɛ biala kamɛ. Ni kafɔɔ Yuda batii batandiɛ Purim ayi ya mmle dii ole, ee onyuma ninya didie di banantii lɛma kamɛ.<verse eid="EST 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EST 9:29" />Nioso Abihail obisankobi, Ɔkasanko Ester ku Mordekai, Yuda otii nwu lakpana kukũ ku sɛkambi simuu baatika difuɔ di kukũ ko mmle nyɔɔfa diafe ni di Purim suoto. <verse eid="EST 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EST 9:30" />Ni di Mordekai layɔ akũ nwu aakyesee Yuda batii bamuu ba ninkpe ni di Akasweros sɛka kalekɔ nsɔ kɔlafa-afosi-anyɔ-nkuɛnsĩ nwu nɛ- dibiene ku disi otika sɛlaa- <verse eid="EST 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EST 9:31" />alɛ batɛ Purim ayi ya mmle di obe wɔ baatɛ ni kanya, fɛ mmle di Mordekai, Yuda otii nwu ku Ɔkasanko Ester lakpee ni kufiofa aata ma nii, ku mmle kafɔɔ baatɔɔtɛ bɛɛta ni suoto lɛma ku banantii lɛma, mmle baayɔ nwu ni ole di kanya onii ku kaku owi lɛma obe kamɛ. <verse eid="EST 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EST 9:32" />Ester kufiofa nwu latika difuɔ di Purim sɛsaabla se mmle suoto, ni baakpana kũ di akũ kamɛ baatɛ nɛ.<verse eid="EST 9:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EST 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔka Akasweros Ku Mordekai Sɛsaabla Kplɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 10:1" />Ninfɛ di Ɔka Akasweros latika kɔsɔsĩ di sɛka kalekɔ kamuu kualaadu lekpo atoko fanfa nɛ. <verse eid="EST 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 10:2" />Di osie nɔɔ ku asaa kplɛ nɔɔ sɛsaabla simuu ku Mordekai sɛsaabla kplɛ simuu se niata ɔka latakatɛsa nwɔ ni katoo yi, bɛɛkpana nya di Media ku Persia baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="EST 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 10:3" />Mordekai, Yuda otii nwu niale nnwɔ niatikanko ni Ɔka Akasweros, di kayilakɔ kanya nɛ. Otii finle aale di Yuda batii kamɛ, baatɔɔ dibu le niataka ni katoo di bawo nɔɔ, Yuda batii kamɛ, diekye aabla ɔkpɛ aata batii nɔɔ dibiene, aakakatɛ kafɔɔ diata ni Yuda batii bamuu lɛlɛ.<verse eid="EST 10:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 10" />
</usx>